WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Lunar Field Expedition: the Apollo 15 site, rebuilt from NASA LROC terrain data

2
00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:08.003
Module 1: start from the whole Moon, then land at Hadley–Apennine

3
00:00:08.003 --> 00:00:17.004
A short approach shot over Hadley Rille, captioned and skippable

4
00:00:17.004 --> 00:00:19.506
Skip any cinematic from the first frame (Esc)

5
00:00:19.506 --> 00:00:24.517
Module 2: at first light, every small bump casts a long shadow

6
00:00:24.517 --> 00:00:29.021
At high noon, the same ground looks flat

7
00:00:29.021 --> 00:00:36.022
Walk the site: click a glowing ring to glide in (simplified LM and rover; illustrative crew motion)

8
00:00:36.022 --> 00:00:40.524
Module 3: count craters to compare the ages of surfaces

9
00:00:40.524 --> 00:00:45.026
Module 4: plan a sampling traverse, then drive it

10
00:00:45.026 --> 00:00:49.530
Module 5: defend a claim with evidence, then compare it with what the crew found

11
00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:54.037
Text mode covers every objective and decision without the 3D view

12
00:00:54.037 --> 00:00:57.545
Free, no account, no tracking: immersive-learning-showcase.vercel.app
